    "loreSummary": "The road west out of the junction ends at the village here, and so does the water: this is one of three surveyed regions on Thirstwold with a spring on it, and all seven desert springs the world has charted are on this landmass. Parties work the seam where the river ground runs out into the sand \u2014 water off the two crossings, and whatever the dune front has finished with."
